{
  "version": "2.11",
  "children": [
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "foot001",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 80,
      "name": "12 Footer - Prompt",
      "width": 1200,
      "fill": "$canvas-white",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 16,
      "padding": 32,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "foot002",
          "name": "title",
          "fill": "$text-ink",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Footer",
          "fontFamily": "$font-display",
          "fontSize": 48,
          "lineHeight": 1,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "foot003",
          "name": "usage-context",
          "fill": "$text-ink",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Used at the bottom of every page. It closes the site with navigation, newsletter/signup area, social/legal links, copyright, and optional brand statement.",
          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
          "fontSize": 18,
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "foot004",
          "name": "pencil-visual-prompt",
          "fill": "$text-ink",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Prompt: Using root DESIGN.MD as the primary design source and DESIGN.pen as the Pencil component library, create an editable footer component. Reuse footer-newsletter, footer link, button-secondary, and form patterns from DESIGN.pen. Create desktop and mobile variants. Use a dark near-black footer, muted links, white headings, coral newsletter label, email input, footer columns, legal microcopy, and current-year copyright. Keep it calm, organized, and scan-friendly. Target code file: src/components/_footer.hbs.",
          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "footcode",
          "name": "html-css-code-prompt",
          "fill": "$text-ink",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Code prompt: Convert this footer design into src/components/_footer.hbs. Use the current .pen file as the visual source of truth, root DESIGN.MD as the design authority, DESIGN.pen as the component library reference, and tailwind.config.js as the code token source. Generate production-ready Hamlet Builder Handlebars markup with Tailwind CSS classes. Return only the partial markup for src/components/_footer.hbs. Do not generate React, JSX, CSS Modules, Vue, external CSS frameworks, or unrelated JavaScript. Use semantic HTML and accessible attributes. Preserve Blogger dynamic behavior where relevant with Blogger/Hamlet tags and realistic placeholders only where dynamic data is unavailable. After copying the output into the repo, npm run build must pass.",
          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
